<title>JAPAN: Japan rubber stocks fall at end of May.</title>
<headline>Japan rubber stocks fall at end of May.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>End-May rubber stock figures, issued by the Japan Rubber Trade Association, with month-earlier and year-earlier comparisons, in tonnes, were as follows:</p>
<p>    Month	    May 97   Apr 97   May 96</p>
<p>    Stocks	   40,637   44,105   41,725</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks, in tonnes</p>
<p>    Crude rubber   36,244   39,589   34,638</p>
<p>    Synthetic	 4,240    4,361    6,993</p>
<p>    Latex		 153	155	 94</p>
</text>
